  ('bc1e294f-2b85-5327-8c2e-b31b1caf3502', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g11-character-setting-plot'), null, 'medium',
   $q$What role does Osei's attempt to "prove her wrong" play in the plot?$q$, $q$[{"text":"It is the opening event, which introduces the conflict of the fable.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-sequence"},{"text":"It is a minor detail that has no effect on how Osei behaves later.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"It is the moment Osei proves that Pemba exaggerated the danger.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"It is the turning point, where Osei discovers the truth for himself.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$It is the turning point, where Osei discovers the truth for himself.$q$, $q$When he "could not touch bottom," Osei learns firsthand that the river changed, and his behavior changes the next day. The conflict began earlier, with his careless answer to Pemba.$q$, 'draft', '55ebc6fd-66db-5ce8-b1af-b853af85f1cf')
