   $q$What does the opening sentence establish about Dao?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She took the internship for the pay and has little interest in the work at first.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She has studied salamanders for years and hopes to become a field scientist.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She chose the internship because she enjoys working early in the morning.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She dislikes Dr. Asante and plans to quit the internship before spring ends.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She took the internship for the pay and has little interest in the work at first.$q$, $q$The story opens by saying she agreed "because it paid, not because she cared about salamanders." That starting point is what her later actions are measured against; nothing suggests she plans to quit.$q$, 'draft', '336999ff-fe0f-5352-98d3-9a8e128be4d7')
