   $q$Why does the author wait until after Dao's count to reveal the twenty-two-year notebook?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Revealed afterward, the record shows that Dr. Asante does not trust interns with old data.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Revealed afterward, the record recasts her small count as part of a long, declining history.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Revealed afterward, the record proves that Dao's count is wrong and must be thrown out.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Revealed afterward, the record explains why the pool dries up each summer by July.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"confuses-cause-effect"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Revealed afterward, the record recasts her small count as part of a long, declining history.$q$, $q$Once Dao has made her own count, the notebook shows it joining two decades of data with a downward trend, which prompts her question about why to keep counting. Nothing in the notebook disproves her count.$q$, 'draft', '336999ff-fe0f-5352-98d3-9a8e128be4d7')
